# CMake's generated build tree. This contains CMakeCache.txt, which
# hardcodes the absolute path it was configured from -- if this folder
# ever gets committed, GitHub Actions (or any other machine/path) will
# fail to configure with:
#   "CMake Error: The current CMakeCache.txt directory ... is different
#    than the directory ... where CMakeCache.txt was created."
build/
out/

# Where `cmake --install` / build_windows.bat place the finished exe.
dist/

# Downloaded by build_windows.bat / the GitHub Actions workflow to fetch
# the WebView2 SDK -- always re-fetched fresh, never needs to be committed.
packages/
nuget.exe

# Editor/OS noise
.vs/
*.user
Thumbs.db
